CM_ SG_ 392 RollingCounter "protocol-validated; source 03-V3. Modulo 4 per identifier; discontinuity is not an exact loss count.";
CM_ SG_ 500 Raw_B0_bits0_2 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 03-MAP. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 500 WiperMode "high; source 03-V3. 2003 manual-up shares high state. Mist, washer and intermittent delay are not independently decoded.";
VAL_ 500 WiperMode 0 "off" 1 "intermittent" 2 "low" 3 "high or manual-up";
CM_ SG_ 500 LeftTurnRequest "high; source 03-V3. Request/state, not actual lamp flash phase. A hazard encoding is not established.";
CM_ SG_ 500 RightTurnRequest "high; source 03-V3. Request/state, not actual lamp flash phase. Do not manufacture hazards by OR-ing turn bits.";
CM_ SG_ 500 Raw_B0_bits7_7 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 03-MAP. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 500 DimmerRaw "working-interpretation; source 03-PATCH. Later decoder implements ordinary range 0..99 with special 0xE4 full-bright handling. Not calibrated optical brightness; keep raw.";
CM_ SG_ 500 UnidentifiedB2 "unknown; source 03-V3. 2003 one 0x04 transient; 2007 zero in examined recordings. Constancy is not proof of unused/reserved.";
CM_ SG_ 500 OdometerRaw "maintainer-confirmed-scale; source 03-ODO. Derived miles=raw/1.61 by later dashboard comparison. DBC retains raw to distinguish this from true SI kilometers. Absolute readings intentionally withheld.";
CM_ SG_ 500 Raw_B6 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 03-MAP. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 500 Raw_B7_bits0_5 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 03-MAP. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 500 RollingCounter "protocol-validated; source 03-V3. Modulo 4 per identifier; discontinuity is not an exact loss count.";
CM_ SG_ 548 Raw_B0 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 03-MAP. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
CM_ SG_ 548 UnidentifiedB1 "unknown; source 03-V3. 03 observed F3..F6; 07 F3..F5. Slow-changing raw field; direct LTFT/MAP/ECT/fuel-level/count identities unsupported.";
CM_ SG_ 548 FuelAccumulatorRaw "high; source 03-V3. Even BE16 raw values; normalized=raw>>1. Raw modulo65536, normalized modulo32768. Reset/gap-aware increments only. Volume factor configurable and not an OEM scale.";
CM_ SG_ 548 Raw_B4 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 03-MAP. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
