CM_ SG_ 548 ChargingWarningCandidate "candidate; source 03-MAP. 2003 charging-system candidate; 2007 battery lamp identified. Not measured voltage or charging-health certification.";
CM_ SG_ 548 Raw_B6_bits2_7 "unknown-or-unexcited; source 03-MAP. Unmapped region retained verbatim. May be constant or an unexercised feature; not manufacturer-reserved by inference.";
